["Stark County in the Farmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/north-dakota/stark-county"],["ARC or PLC in Stark County","/arc-plc/north-dakota/stark-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on Stark County runs 75 years, 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 13 grids October to November came in under 90% of normal in 42 of them. The 2026 pairs published so far all ran low on the middle, with June to July at 55% of normal in 2026. The preliminary estimate for July to August 2026 on grid 32209 is 89.6, and RMA&rsquo;s final index can differ. Grid 32209 had its driest year in 1988 at 57%.</p>"}
